/**
 * @defgroup gridlock Gridlock Watchface
 *
 * The Gridlock face itself: the grid it resolves, its layouts, its night handling, theme, and
 * settings schema. Everything here is specific to this face. It sits on the @ref family-mosaic
 * tier, which carries the panel bodies it shares with Sidereel, and that sits on @ref lib.
 *
 * The subgroups below split it up by job.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_engine Engine
 * @ingroup gridlock
 *
 * The grid engine and the pieces around it: the catalog of modules, the layouts, and the app
 * setup in main. It hands each cell its own clipped layer and repaints when a reading changes.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_draw Draw Helpers
 * @ingroup gridlock
 *
 * Shared drawing helpers the modules lean on: the panel frame, the stat panel drawer, icons,
 * metrics, and the header fonts. Keeps every module painting the same shapes the same way.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_settings Settings and Theme
 * @ingroup gridlock
 *
 * The face's own settings schema, its persist keys, and the theme colours. This is where the
 * face names its fields and picks the palette each module draws with.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_dev Dev Tools
 * @ingroup gridlock
 *
 * Development-only helpers, like the tap cycle that previews layouts and styles. Off in a
 * normal build.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_modules Panel Modules
 * @ingroup gridlock
 *
 * The panels only this face draws, split by what they show. The ones it shares with Sidereel
 * live in @ref mosaic_modules instead.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_mod_time Time
 * @ingroup gridlock_modules
 *
 * Clock, date, other time zones, the moon, and swatch .beats.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_mod_weather Weather
 * @ingroup gridlock_modules
 *
 * The current weather plus the many readouts around it: temperature, wind, humidity, the
 * sun times, the forecast strips, and friends.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_mod_calendar Calendar
 * @ingroup gridlock_modules
 *
 * The agenda, the countdown to the next event, and the free or busy view.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_mod_stock Stock
 * @ingroup gridlock_modules
 *
 * A single quote and the watchlist of a few tickers.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup gridlock_mod_system System
 * @ingroup gridlock_modules
 *
 * The watch's own bits: battery, the phone connection, and the quiet time marker.
 */
